Benchmark adaptations: 128x85 pixels, four samples per pixel, depth ten;
render directly on the main thread; compute and print a weighted RGB checksum;
write PPM only when an output filename is supplied; replace Array.mkArray
with Array.replicate for Lean 4.34. Rendering mathematics and RNG are unchanged.
